---
description: Sets standards for testing NestJS applications, including unit, integration, and end-to-end tests with Vitest.
globs: "**/*.spec.ts"
---
- Use Vitest for testing. Newly generated NestJS projects use Vitest by default, and CommonJS projects use Jest.
- Write tests for each controller and service.
- Write end to end tests for each api module.
- Add an admin/test method to each controller as a smoke test.